2. Have you run a competitor teardown on the top 5 funding ads our prospects already see? Yes or no. If no, why not after I've raised it repeatedly?
3. Is $300 CPQBC your floor or your ceiling? What would it take to test a cheaper channel (DM-based) in parallel instead of sequentially?
4. Is the medical-practice-owner ICP a validated assumption or a guess? What data supports it over W2 professionals or general business owners?
5. Which core fundamentals from the DFY program (unique mechanism, hook, timeline, CTA, retention) are intentionally not in the current VSL, and what is the reasoning for each omission?
6. What specifically changes in your approach if iteration 4 also misses?
*What I'd want from you to build the next move*
• The actual VSL script or hook (first 30 seconds) so we can diagnose the differentiation gap directly.
• The 3 ad angles already tested, so we're not repeating a burned message.


